},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Sign in to sync"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/23"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Which skills are worth learning?"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"There’s no option for anyone under 16 to “get a job”: any employer who hires them faces a fine of $5000 per month, and those willing to do so are breaking the law"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Adding “education’s value” to mortality statistics: each extra year of schooling reduces adult mortality by roughly 1.9%"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Before deciding whether educational qualifications have lost value, check China’s education profile: only 15467 per 100000 have college-level education (2020 census; about 19% estimated in the 2025 sample survey)"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Run the policy math first: most vocational school tuition is waived, with a 2300‑yuan grant and up to 20000 yuan in student loans per year"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Failing to get into regular high school doesn’t mean your path ends: secondary vocational schools offer linked admission programs and separate exams, and employers can lower educational requirements for skilled roles"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Treat “work now or keep studying” as one calculation: three years of wages from going to work first, against the yearly income gap over the following decades that further study buys"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Keep this baseline in mind: on average worldwide, each additional year of schooling yields a personal return of roughly 9% per year"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Before spending money on a certification, first verify whether it appears in the National Vocational Qualification Catalogue or in the list of evaluation agencies registered with the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Security"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"It’s best to use government subsidies for training — don’t jump straight to paying for commercial courses out of pocket"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"When picking a skill to learn, prioritize those that require hands-on work and on-the-spot judgment — these are the hardest for automation to replace"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Check first whether a skill has an official grading system and if those grades can translate into pay raises"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Don’t take “high wages advertised online” as proof of labor shortages — check local lists of in‑demand occupations and subsidy programs instead"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"For the same cost and time, prioritize short-duration programs that lead directly to employment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/23-14","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"After studying, close the book and test yourself — don’t just reread it"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Spread the same study time over several days instead of cramming it all at once"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Don’t treat highlighting, rereading, and summarizing as primary study methods"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Mixing different types of exercises rather than doing twenty of the same kind"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Don’t pick learning methods based on “I’m a visual learner, he’s an auditory learner”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Test yourself using questions based on how you’ll use the material later; don’t just recite it verbatim"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"First, figure out which professional series and level you belong to, then find the right application channels based on your employer type"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Entry- and intermediate-level accounting titles are earned via a national unified exam; first check your education level and work experience to see if you qualify"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Don’t hire agents to handle evaluations, don’t pay for ghostwritten papers, and don’t falsify any application materials: any proven violations will result in immediate revocation of your professional title and a 3-year entry in your integrity record"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/23-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Having a professional title doesn’t automatically mean a pay raise: first find out whether your employer uses a post‑based quota for evaluation and hiring, or if getting the title doesn’t guarantee a post or raise"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/23"},"children":["Chapter 23"," ·"," ","Which skills are worth learning?"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"23-14"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["14"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["After studying, close the book and test yourself — don’t just reread it"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Rereading a section often makes it seem very familiar, but that doesn’t mean you’ve actually retained it well. Testing yourself after reading yields noticeably better results. In classrooms where brief quizzes are added, average test scores rise by a moderate amount. When ranking ten common study methods, self-testing comes out on top. After finishing a section, try writing down the key points from memory before checking them against the text."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There’s no cost involved, and no extra time is needed. Use…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["A meta-analysis of 222 separate studies involving 48478 students found that classroom quizzes led to a moderat…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: After studying, close the book and test yourself — don’t just reread it"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There’s no cost involved, and no extra time is needed. Use the time you’d otherwise spend rereading to write down or answer questions from memory instead. The difficulty lies in how uncomfortable it feels to confront what you’ve forgotten right away, compared to the relative ease of rereading."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["A meta-analysis of 222 separate studies involving 48478 students found that classroom quizzes led to a moderate improvement in academic performance (effect size g = 0.499). This effect varies depending on several factors: the baseline study method used in the control group, how closely the quiz format matches the final exam, whether the material is comparable, whether corrective feedback is provided, how many times the quiz is administered, when and where it takes place, how long the intervention lasts, and the experimental design used. Another comprehensive review that evaluated all ten widely used study techniques rated “practice testing” and “spaced practice” as the most effective methods overall. Their high utility stems from proven success across learners of different ages and abilities, as well as in diverse testing formats and real-world educational settings."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Yang C, Luo L, Vadillo MA, Yu R, Shanks DR (2021). Testing (quizzing) boosts classroom learning: A systematic and meta-analytic review. Psychological Bulletin, 147(4), 399–435. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/bul0000309","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1037/bul0000309"]},"；Dunlosky J, Rawson KA, Marsh EJ, Nathan MJ, Willingham DT (2013). Improving Students' Learning With Effective Learning Techniques: Promising Directions From Cognitive and Educational Psychology. Psychological Science in the Public Interest, 14(1), 4–58. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1177/1529100612453266","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1177/1529100612453266"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/bul0000309","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Self-testing is meant to force information out of your memory, not to assign grades. The recommended approach is to write down key points from memory after reading a section, then check them against the text. Providing corrective feedback further boosts effectiveness, so it’s important to carefully review why each answer was incorrect. The “large” magnitude of benefit mentioned here is determined by both the effect size and the overall rating. Since these studies measured academic outcomes rather than time saved, they weren’t evaluated against time‑saving thresholds. Self-testing and the method described in item 15 — spreading the same amount of study time across several days — are the two highest‑rated strategies identified in the same review; using them together yields the best results."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/23-13"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"For the same cost and time, prioritize short-duration programs that lead directly to employment"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/23-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"Spread the same study time over several days instead of cramming it all at once"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hid